  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Very small internal improvement to Text.FormatHelpers.StripQuotes() family of methods.\n      The peSHIr.States classes use (more) LanguageSupport for their descriptions/ToString.\n      Corrected typing error in Text.LanguageSupport.DutchText.OneMinuteAgo.\n      Added more unit tests to peSHIr.Caching, surfacing a bug.\n      Corrected a bug in peSHIr.Caching that expired the most recent (instead of the oldest) item when making room in a cache.\n      Made sure SystemHelper.InnermostMessage() returns huh.Message when the InnermostException() object might have a NULL message.\n      Added SystemHelper.AddData() to add a key/value pair to the exception Data dictionary.\n      Added overloads to SystemHelper.SetExceptionInfo() to optionally also add a key/value pair to the exception Data dictionary.\n      SystemHelper.SetExceptionInfo() tries to add a text description of any non-zero HResult to the Exception.Data dictionary.\n      Made sure to use SystemHelper.NotSupported() as much as possible internally.\n      Added Parse/FromString() overloads taking a CultureInfo to Fraction32/UFraction32. (Previous version explicitly use CurrentUICulture now.)\n      Added AssemblyMetaData.InformationalVersion to give you access to one more assembly attribute.",
